# MiSide pack — git hygiene (AGENTS.md rule 5: game data never enters git)
# Raw client stays off-repo: A:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\MiSide\

# Heavy raw-layer extraction outputs stay local-only (extraction-host.md);
# curated datasets/relinks/logic/PROOF artifacts ARE committed when produced.
# questions.md §8 ruling: Il2CppDumper output joins the local-only set.
extracted/harvest/
extracted/decompiled/
extracted/art/
extracted/media/
extracted/il2cpp/

# Site build
node_modules/
.next/
out/

# Pipeline run outputs (census/stage artifacts land here; curated commits are
# copied to data/ explicitly, never the whole dir)
output/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/

# Ephemeral agent logs (hey.md-class, cleaned as they grow)
docs/logs/

# Agent scratch
tmp/
